ustomers. Williams owns an interest in and operates over 32,000 miles of pipelines in 24 states and in the Gulf of America, 35 natural gas processing facilities, 9 NGL fractionation facilities, approximately 23 million barrels of NGL storage capacity, and 423 Bcf of natural gas storage capacity, and delivers natural gas that is used every day for clean-power generation, heating, and industrial use.","zh":"威廉斯是一家能源公司，致力於成為安全交付天然氣產品以可靠地推動清潔能源經濟的基礎設施領域的領導者。 Williams 在 11 個供應區域開展業務，提供天然氣收集和加工 (G&P)、傳輸和儲存服務； NGL 分餾、運輸和儲存服務；為約 800 名客戶提供行銷服務。 Williams 擁有並經營遍布 24 個州和美洲灣的超過 32,000 英里的管道、35 個天然氣加工設施、9 個 NGL 分餾設施、約 2300 萬桶 NGL 存儲容量和 423 Bcf 的天然氣存儲容量，並提供每天用於清潔發電、供暖和工業用途的天然氣。"},{"en":"Williams was founded in 1908, originally incorporated under the laws of the state of Nevada in 1949 and reincorporated under the laws of the state of Delaware in 1987. Its common stock trades on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol \"WMB.\" Its operations are located in the United States. Williams' headquarters are located in Tulsa, Oklahoma, with other major offices in Houston, Texas; Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania; and Salt Lake City, Utah.","zh":"Williams 成立於 1908 年，最初於 1949 年根據內華達州法律註冊成立，並於 1987 年根據特拉華州法律重新註冊。其普通股在紐約證券交易所交易，代號為「WMB」。其業務位於美國。威廉斯的總部位於俄克拉荷馬州塔爾薩，其他主要辦公室位於德州休士頓；賓州匹茲堡；和猶他州鹽湖城。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Consistent with the manner in which Williams' chief operating decision maker (CODM) evaluates performance and allocates resources, Williams' operations are conducted, managed, and presented in Part I of this Annual Report within the following reportable segments: Transmission, Power & Gulf; Northeast G&P; West; and Gas & NGL Marketing Services. All remaining business activities, including upstream operations and corporate activities, are included in Other. See Part II, Item 8. Financial Statements and Supplementary Data in Note 1 – Description of Business, Basis of Presentation, and Summary of Significant Accounting Policies for a full description of each segment.","zh":"與威廉斯首席營運決策者 (CODM) 評估業績和分配資源的方式一致，威廉斯的營運在本年度報告第一部分的以下可報告部門中進行、管理和介紹：傳輸、電力和海灣；東北G&P；西方;以及天然氣和液化天然氣行銷服務。所有剩餘的業務活動，包括上游業務和公司活動，均包含在「其他」中。有關每個分部的完整說明，請參閱第二部分第 8 項：附註 1 中的財務報表和補充資料－業務描述、列報基礎和重要會計政策摘要。"},{"en":"Detailed discussion of each of our reportable segments follows. For a discussion of ongoing expansion projects, see Part II, Item 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.","zh":"我們每個可報告分部的詳細討論如下。有關正在進行的擴張項目的討論，請參閱第二部分第 7 項：管理層對財務狀況和經營業績的討論和分析。"}],"customers":[{"en":"During 2025, Williams' facilities gathered and processed gas for approximately 253 customers. The top ten customers accounted for approximately 55 percent of gathering and processing fee revenues and NGL margins from noncash commodity-based agreements. Williams believes counterparty credit concerns in its gathering and processing businesses are significantly mitigated by the physical nature of Williams' services, where gathering occurs at the wellhead and therefore is critical to a producer's ability to move product to market.","zh":"2025 年，Williams 的設施為約 253 名客戶收集和加工天然氣。前十大客戶約佔非現金商品協議的收集和處理費收入以及 NGL 利潤的 55%。威廉斯認為，威廉斯服務的物理性質大大減輕了其收集和加工業務中的交易對手信用擔憂，威廉斯服務的物理性質是在井口進行收集，因此對於生產商將產品推向市場的能力至關重要。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Reportable Segment Aggregation Before Other Operating","val":12633000000,"zh":"其他經營分部之前的可報告分部總結"},{"name":"Gas NGL Marketing Services","val":6047000000,"zh":"天然氣液化天然氣行銷服務"},{"name":"Transmission Power Gulf","val":5443000000,"zh":"輸電海灣"},{"name":"West","val":2847000000,"zh":"西方"},{"name":"Northeast GP","val":2168000000,"zh":"東北大獎賽"}],"total":14899000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":8440000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Non Regulated Service Monetary Consideration","val":4372000000,"zh":"非監管服務貨幣考慮"},{"name":"Regulated Service","val":3721000000,"zh":"受監管的服務"},{"name":"Non Regulated Service Commodity Consideration","val":192000000,"zh":"非管制服務商品考慮"},{"name":"Other Service","val":155000000,"zh":"其他服務"},{"name":"Energy Commodities & Service","val":120000000,"zh":"能源商品及服務"}],"total":14899000000}},"peers":["OKE","KMI","DVN","EOG","EPD"]}}